Usage: pinky [OPTION]... [USER]...

A lightweight finger-compatible user information tool.

OPTIONS:
  -l             produce long format output
  -b             omit the user home directory and shell in long format
  -f             omit the line of column headings in short format
  -w             omit the user full name in short format
  -i             omit the user full name and remote host in short format
  -q             omit the user full name, remote host, and idle time
  -h             omit the user project file in long format
  -p             omit the user plan file in long format
  -s             do short format output
      --lookup   attempt to canonicalize hostnames
      --help     display this help and exit
  -V, --version  output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
